/*
 * GENERATED by tools/gen_link_stubs.py -- do not edit by hand.
 *
 * Bring-up scaffolding for the native headless host.  KICAD_HEADLESS_API does not build the GUI
 * half of pcbnew and eeschema, but a number of the translation units it does keep still
 * *reference* it from branches that only run with an editor frame (a job handler falling back to
 * its dialog, a tool asking the selection tool for a selection, ...).  This file defines every
 * one of those references: functions alias a thunk that prints a backtrace and aborts, and
 * vtables, typeinfos, event ids and class statics are zeroed placeholders.
 *
 * Nothing here is meant to run.  An abort inside the thunk means a headless guard is missing:
 * fix the guard, or build the source the symbol comes from, then regenerate.  A *duplicate
 * symbol* error means a stub is no longer needed -- also regenerate.  host/STATUS-native-gate.md
 * tracks what is left.  The wasm build gets the same behaviour from
 * -sERROR_ON_UNDEFINED_SYMBOLS=0 and needs no equivalent.
 */

#include <cstdio>
#include <cstdlib>

